From 5ce595cab260cee6541d3e5fc4928130e54438e7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Omobolaji Olaniyan <omobolaayobamiolaniyan@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 09:13:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix auth defects, restore missing modules, add tests, CI and
 documentation

- Put the customer id in the JWT subject, not the password hash
- Remove the JwtAuthGuard from the login route (a token was required
  in order to obtain a token)
- Read roles from the authenticated principal, not the request body
- Add the missing datesMatch and TimeUnit modules so the existing
  test suite runs; add a test script, which did not exist
- Fix the JwtModule secret ('process.env.JWT_SECRET' as a literal)
- Align the Role enum with the database values
- Set passReqToCallback on the refresh strategy
- Validate configuration at boot; reject equal JWT secrets
- Hash seeded passwords; never seed in production
- Delete dead half-implementations and eval() in config
- Add 28 tests, GitHub Actions CI, and a README
